{"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem"],"anchor":"Guides","title":"Guides","generated":true}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PlatformImageLoader"},{"type":"text","text":" uses vendored, namespaced pure Swift format decoders and always returns non-premultiplied 8-bit RGBA pixels in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage"},{"type":"text","text":". Animated images and formats other than PNG and JPEG are not supported. JPEG input is limited to 8-bit grayscale and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"three-component color images."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The format decoder is independent from file and URL lifecycle code. Decoding the same bytes with the same limits therefore produces the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same pixels without accessing the network."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Loading Data or Files","anchor":"Loading-Data-or-Files","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let loader = PlatformImageLoader()","let fromData = try loader.loadImage(from: encodedData)","let fromFile = try loader.loadImage(from: \"\/absolute\/path\/image.png\")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both entry points apply the same validation and return "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoadError"},{"type":"text","text":" when the input cannot be read or decoded."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Resource Limits","anchor":"Resource-Limits","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Configure ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecodingLimits"},{"text":" when creating the loader:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let limits = ImageDecodingLimits(","    maxInputBytes: 8 * 1_024 * 1_024,","    maxDimension: 4_096,","    maxPixelCount: 12_000_000,","    maxFrameCount: 1,","    maxDecodedBytes: 48 * 1_024 * 1_024,","    maxDecompressedBytes: 48 * 1_024 * 1_024",")","let loader = PlatformImageLoader(limits: limits)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit inspects the image header and validates encoded bytes, dimensions, pixels, frames, decompressed source samples, and the final RGBA"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"allocation before invoking a format decoder. A per-call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxPixelCount"},{"type":"text","text":" can tighten the loader-wide pixel limit but cannot loosen it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PNG ancillary metadata is discarded because "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage"},{"type":"text","text":" has no metadata surface. This also prevents compressed text or color-profile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"chunks from allocating outside the image decompression limit. PNG image-data chunks are fed to the decoder in bounded pieces, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"malformed trailing decompressed data is rejected."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"URL loading streams encoded bytes and cancels the transfer as soon as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxInputBytes"},{"text":" is exceeded. Cached images are revalidated against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the current loader’s dimensions, pixels, frame, and final allocation limits before they are returned.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/imagedecoding"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecoding"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PlatformImageLoader","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoader"],"anchor":"Loading","title":"Loading"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecodingLimits","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBA","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoadError"],"anchor":"Data-and-Limits","title":"Data and Limits"}],"sections":[],"kind":"article","metadata":{"roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Image Decoding","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Load static PNG and JPEG images safely on macOS and Linux."}],"references":{"tuikit-logo.png":{"type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/TUIkit\/tuikit-logo.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"TUIkit Logo","identifier":"tuikit-logo.png"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/StatusBarGuide":{"url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/statusbarguide","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","role":"article","kind":"article","title":"Status Bar","abstract":[{"text":"Configure the shortcut bar